{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2735", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2735/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2735/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2735/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2735", "id": 3719229855, "node_id": "I_kwDOBabE0s7drvGf", "number": 2735, "title": "call download_mission() err:  Waypoint frame not supported unsupported", "user": {"login": "Staok", "id": 59993573, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjU5OTkzNTcz", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59993573?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Staok", "html_url": "https://github.com/Staok", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Staok/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Staok/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Staok/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Staok/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Staok/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Staok/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Staok/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Staok/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Staok/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [{"id": 629977272, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw2Mjk5NzcyNzI=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/labels/question", "name": "question", "color": "cc317c", "default": true, "description": null}], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 2, "created_at": "2025-12-11T12:36:35Z", "updated_at": "2025-12-15T08:19:19Z", "closed_at": "2025-12-14T22:54:56Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "NONE", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "Steps:\n\nRun a ardurover SITL:\n```\ncd ~/ardupilot && . ~/.profile\nTools/autotest/sim_vehicle.py -v Rover -f rover --console --map --out=udp:0.0.0.0:14550\n```\n\nI use its Mission Editor add some waypoints:\n\n<img width=\"1087\" height=\"237\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d7b98864-e217-475e-81cb-08946110fc79\" />\n\nRun my app:\n```\n        // get mission way points to store in live info\n        {\n            DEBUG_LOGI(\"start async getting waypoints...\");\n            mavsdkBindPtr->missionPtr->download_mission_with_progress_async(\n                [this](mavsdk::Mission::Result result, mavsdk::Mission::ProgressDataOrMission data){\n                    (void)result;\n                    // if(result != mavsdk::Mission::Result::Success) {\n                    //     DEBUG_LOGE(\"getting waypoints failed: %d\", static_cast<int32_t>(result));\n                    //     return;\n                    // }\n                    if(data.has_progress) {\n                        DEBUG_LOGI(\"getting waypoints progress: %f\", data.progress);\n                    }\n                    if(data.has_mission) {\n\n                                for(const auto& wp : data.mission_plan.mission_items) {\n                                    ...\n                                }\n                                DEBUG_LOGI(\"get waypoints finished\");\n                            \n                        );\n                    }\n                }\n            );\n        }\n```\n\nAnd get print result:\n```\ngetting waypoints progress: 0.000000\ngetting waypoints progress: 0.333333\ngetting waypoints progress: 0.666667\ngetting waypoints progress: 1.000000\n[08:17:47|Debug] Assembling Message: 0 (mission_impl.cpp:655)\n[08:17:47|Error] Waypoint frame not supported unsupported (mission_impl.cpp:660) \u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014 here\n```\n\n\nThe mavsdk src code:\n```\nstd::pair<Mission::Result, Mission::MissionPlan> MissionImpl::convert_to_result_and_mission_items(\n    MavlinkMissionTransferClient::Result result,\n    const std::vector<MavlinkMissionTransferClient::ItemInt>& int_items)\n{\n    std::pair<Mission::Result, Mission::MissionPlan> result_pair;\n\n    result_pair.first = convert_result(result);\n    if (result_pair.first != Mission::Result::Success) {\n        return result_pair;\n    }\n\n    _mission_data.mavlink_mission_item_to_mission_item_indices.clear();\n\n    Mission::DownloadMissionCallback callback;\n    {\n        _enable_return_to_launch_after_mission = false;\n\n        MissionItem new_mission_item{};\n        bool have_set_position = false;\n\n        for (const auto& int_item : int_items) {\n            LogDebug() << \"Assembling Message: \" << int(int_item.seq);\n\n            if (int_item.command == MAV_CMD_NAV_WAYPOINT ||\n                int_item.command == MAV_CMD_NAV_TAKEOFF) {\n                if (int_item.frame != MAV_FRAME_GLOBAL_RELATIVE_ALT_INT) {\n                    LogErr() << \"Waypoint frame not supported unsupported\"; \u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014 here\n                    result_pair.first = Mission::Result::Unsupported;\n                    break;\n                }\n```", "closed_by": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/